      ],
      "what_pmid_40184040_did_NOT_test": [
        "Causal necessity of Cxcr6+ TRM (vs correlation)",
        "Adoptive transfer rescue of chronic phenotype",
        "Cxcr6 blockade or genetic loss phenocopying Batf3-/- chronic attenuation"
